face-models
Copyright 2026 Akoos <https://akoos.eu>

This repository redistributes face-ML models and adds its own packaging and
documentation. Each model keeps its upstream license. The v2 files are ONNX
exports produced from the upstream published weights; the v1 files are
unmodified OpenCV Zoo blobs.

